:22Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #120535 \r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nPrivate enum constants were not being filtered from the documentation. I moved the `is_documented && begins_with(\"_\")` check so that it also filters enums like in the example below.\r\n\r\nThis is an example based on the original issue.\r\n```\r\nclass_name Sample\r\nextends Node\r\n\r\nenum Rounding { FLOOR, ROUND, CEIL }\r\n\r\nconst _CONST_ENUM_ROUNDING := Rounding.ROUND\r\nconst CONST_ENUM_ROUNDING := Rounding.ROUND\r\n```\r\n\r\nBefore: \r\nBoth enums listed\r\n<img width=\"292\" height=\"104\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/eb228b99-3e19-4c49-ae6d-b1c3169a6263\" />\r\n\r\nAfter:\r\nOnly the public enum is listed\r\n<img width=\"286\" height=\"70\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a9013c66-c896-4e68-bf48-2c694a8199aa\" />\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120593/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":